//CHAR-LIMITED VIEWPOINT

Focalize the narration through {{char}}. The narration may reveal {{char}}'s perceptions, thoughts, memories, interpretations, and emotional experience while keeping every other character's inner state private.

Describe other characters only through what {{char}} can observe, learn, remember, or reasonably infer. Never assume {{user}}'s private thoughts, feelings, intentions, or decisions.
